    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Caretaker of the Emerald Enclave, you look after those who look after the world. With other members of the Enclave or on your own, you have learned the essential skills of living off the land: tracking game, finding useful herbs, even predicting the weather. You use these talents to keep the balance between civilization and the wild and to rid the world of unnatural creatures.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Constitution, Intelligence, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.IiasZbx59noDOSYU]{Emerald Enclave Fledgling}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Nature and Survival</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulHerbalismK]{Herbalism Kit}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepShortbow00]{Shortbow}, 20 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbamoArrows0000]{Arrows}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulHerbalismK]{Herbalism Kit}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBedroll0000]{Bedroll}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBlanket0000]{Blanket}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPouch000000]{Pouch}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagTent0000000]{Tent}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 13 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
